#!/bin/sh
# pgBackRest with Zelvo's settings (task F6). Compose passes every PGBACKREST_* setting, some of
# them empty (the S3 repository's when the repository is the backup volume); pgBackRest refuses
# empty options, so they are dropped here before it runs.
for name in $(env | sed -n 's/^\(PGBACKREST_[A-Z0-9_]*\)=$/\1/p'); do
  unset "$name"
done
exec pgbackrest "$@"
